==Description==
Grants passive bonus to profits, based on amount of [[Collectibles|bats]] collected in this Exile, and can be activated to spawn a bat.

The Bat Hunter upgrade [[Market]] purchase will automatically attempt to activate {{PAGENAME}} whenever a bat is caught.

Sometimes referred to as "Batstick".

The restriction on what can drop from bats created by {{ItemTooltip|Chiropteric Rod}} is stronger than the description implies. The things that are still dropable are Void Mana, Mana and Spellshards.

== Details ==

Multiplies profits by:
<br><math>B^R + 1</math>


Activate to spawn a bat.

Charges passively over:
<br><math>\frac{50}{\text{Tier} + 1}</math>
<br>minutes.



where:
* <math>B = \text{Bats Collected This Exile}</math>
* <math>R = \frac{1 + 0.75 \times \text{Tier}}{4} + 1</math>


Tiers:
* <math>\text{Common} = 0</math>
* <math>\text{Uncommon} = 1</math>
* <math>\text{Rare} = 2</math>
* <math>\text{Epic} = 3</math>
* <math>\text{Legendary} = 4</math>
* <math>\text{Unique} = 4</math>


